      "content": "that's helpful. it really is just these little things constantly popping up and draining our resources. it almost feels like the project is being sabotaged by these tiny, invisible additions that just keep growing. do you have any other advice on how to describe that feeling of things just being constantly nibbled away at by these extra tasks?",
